      "summaryZh": "食物基础交易价提高；标准初始买入100食物的价格由130黄金提高到150黄金，卖出所得由70黄金提高到81黄金；木材和石料不变。",
      "source": "https://www.ageofempires.com/news/age-of-empires-ii-definitive-edition-update-preview-125283/",
      "provenance": "official-history",
      "originalText": "Market base exchange rates for food prices increased from 100 → 115, so initial food prices are more expensive and selling provides more gold. Wood and Stone exchange rates are unchanged.\n+ Initial standard gold price for buying 100 food increased from 130 gold → 150 gold.\n+ Initial standard gold reward for selling 100 food increased from 70 gold → 81 gold.",
      "verification": "official",
      "changeType": "mechanic",
      "sourceBullet": "125283-b010",
      "before": "食物基础交易价100",
      "after": "食物基础交易价115",
      "scopeNote": "初始标准价格；买卖两端均变化，不单向判断为加强或削弱。"
    },
